%description:
Admitted M1 IEEE 802.15.4 wire vectors round-trip through the production PCAP
reader, registered protocol dissector and serializer. Both FCS presence modes
must yield typed frames, exact bytes, no parse exception and no raw fallback.
The independently generated fixture/provenance is beside the captures.

%includes:
#include "SerializerTestLib.h"
using namespace inet;

%activity:
cLog::logLevel = LOGLEVEL_WARN;
beginSerializerCoverage();
testPcapSerialization("../../pcap/generated/ieee802154-m1-with-fcs.pcap", true);
testPcapSerialization("../../pcap/generated/ieee802154-m1-no-fcs.pcap", false);
reportSerializerCoverage();

%contains: stdout
Files:  2 tested, 2 clean, 0 with differences

%contains: stdout
Frames: 4 total, 4 same, 0 differ, 0 error, 0 truncated

%contains: stdout
USED inet::Ieee802154Frame

%not-contains: stdout
TOPLEVEL-RAWBYTES

%not-contains: stdout
EXCEPTION

%not-contains: stdout
Some frames differ in file
